{"articleNo":"57234","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=57234&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012-2학기 연계전공 수요조사 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.06.15","hit":"4725","attachments":[{"name":"2012 트랙 연계전공 교육과정 운영지침 및 편성표(연계전공).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=57234&attachNo=68992"},{"name":"연계전공 신청서(LINC).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=57234&attachNo=69002"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">2012-2학기 연계전공 수요조사 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;산학협력선도대학(LINC)육성사업에서 그린에너지융합센터(2012.7.1일자)를 신설하고 2012-2학기부터 연계전공학생을 선발하고자 함에 앞서 연계전공을 희망하는 학생들의 수요조사를 실시하고자 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">1. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2011. 6. 18(월) ~ 6. 28(목) 10일간</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">2. 신청 자격 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3학기 이상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 수료한 모든 재학생</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 선발 예정일 : 2012. 7. 중순경</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 연계전공 명칭 및 이수 정원 (</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">수요조사 후 참여학부 교육과정 반영 예정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">) </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\" valign=\"center\" width=\"266\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">연계전공 명칭(영문명)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\" valign=\"center\" width=\"63\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">선발예정인원</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\" valign=\"center\" width=\"313\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"