IZE: 12pt\">너지？융합소재공학부(고분자공학전공),</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -2.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">소재디자인공학과</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"84\" valign=\"center\" width=\"266\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">그린에너지 시스템 연계전공</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(Major of Green Energy Systems)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"84\" valign=\"center\" width=\"63\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">20</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"84\" valign=\"center\" width=\"313\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전자공학부, 기계공학부, </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">산업시스템공학전공, 환경공학전공,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">토목환경공학부, 건축학부, 컴퓨터공학과,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과, 광시스템공학과,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">메티컬IT융합공학과, 경영학과</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 16.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">연계전공 참여학생들에게는 LINC사업단에서 진행하는 해외신기술견학과 튜터링비를 지원할 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -115pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 116.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">6. 신청 방법 : 연계전공 신청서를 LINC</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">행정실</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(그린에너지관 401호, ☏478-7974) 또는 </span><a href=\"mailto:khy@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">khy@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 로 신청</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">7. 교육과정 이수</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 공학교육인증 : 적용하지 않음</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -37.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복수전공 또는 부전공과 함께 이수할 수 없음</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 연계전공 이수 승인 전에 연계전공 참여 전공에서 이수한 연계전공교과목은 연계전공 이수 교과목으로 인정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 교육과정 이수 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>36학점(필수 14학점, 선택 22학점)</strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -37.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 연계전공에서 이수한 교과목을 주전공에 중복 인정하지 않음</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -38.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">단, 주전공에서 이수한 교과목의 9학점에 한해 연계전공의 이수학점으로 중복 인정</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">9. 기타</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">. 학위수여 : 주전공의 졸업요건과 연계전공의 이수요건을 모두 충족하였을&nbsp;경우 주전공 학위와 함께 수여</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 졸업증서 : 졸업증서 및 학적부에 그 사실을 등재</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt\">2012. 6. 15.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; FONT-SIZE: 19pt\">산학협력선도대학(LINC)사업단</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
